         [1m- `JavaVM::attach_current_thread` (preferred) or `JavaVM::attach_current_thread_for_scope`[0m
         [1m- `JavaVM::with_env` (if certain that the thread is already attached)[0m
         [1m- `UnownedEnv::with_env()` in native methods[0m
         
         [1mWhen migrating to 0.22, if you have a mixture of FFI/non-FFI usage of JNIEnv then err on the side[0m
